lists StellarFulcrum/_4z0/onTrigger StellarFulcrum/onEventUpdate/32000 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/32000 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/32001 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/32002 StellarFulcrum/onZoneIn/1 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/17 StellarFulcrum/_4z1/onTrigger
